{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S06、S13的感受提示比较密集，部分意象解释过满，容易让观众忙着读字、被文字牵引；X的右栏短词更有留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过【】突出每段叙事的关键转折，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住人物的处境和心理变化；感受文字又有大小层级，并按音乐段落出现，兼顾了扫读与听音乐。尤其是从舍不得亲近、记起受过的委屈、害怕孤单，到最后决定带着想念继续生活，Y把人物内心的矛盾和变化串得更清楚。X的双栏结构也容易扫读，但右栏不少词语只是并列的情绪标签，音乐变化、人物感受和叙事要点之间的对应关系不如Y明确，细腻程度也稍逊。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "210225eb-887e-4491-8898-3006c04e8982", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022730938776Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:28:46.508329+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4745a4c09aa95e1f12ebfa0819153c0542e6d002825e8bf77a9f0045f9411881", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to